    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Gurgen,\n\nI previously asked how you track which leads become retained matters. This article looks at the wider issue behind that question.\n\nTwo firms can use the same AI and get different results because they organize the work differently. That's shaping our approach at Possible Minds: start with one process, make responsibilities clear, then add AI.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/c-Q1yfyUUQ\n\nAs a founding partner at YMPK, what seems harder: choosing a tool or agreeing how the team should use it? A quick take would be appreciated.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: Is Lead Docket at YMPK Law Group, LLP tying marketing spend to signed cases?",
